### Booking: hello (anonymous)
POST {{function_url}}/api_booking/hello
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {}
}

### Booking: availabilityList (anonymous for now)
POST {{function_url}}/api_booking/availabilityList
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "fromDate": "2026-05-01",
    "toDate": "2026-05-03"
  }
}

### Booking: availabilitySeed (anonymous playground helper)
POST {{function_url}}/api_booking/availabilitySeed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "fromDate": "2026-05-01",
    "days": 7,
    "capacity": 10
  }
}

### Booking: stayRequestCreate (anonymous playground helper)
POST {{function_url}}/api_booking/stayRequestCreate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "uid": "demo-user",
    "petName": "Milo",
    "startDate": "2026-05-01",
    "endDate": "2026-05-03"
  }
}

### Booking: staysList
POST {{function_url}}/api_booking/staysList
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "limit": 20
  }
}

### Create a review
POST {{function_url}}/api_booking/reviewCreate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "stayId": "2acd039a-5367-45e3-978f-712e1148cfb3",
    "uid": "demo-user",
    "rating": 5,
    "comment": "My pet had a great service"
    }
}

### List reviews for a stay
POST {{function_url}}/api_booking/reviewsList
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "stayId": "2acd039a-5367-45e3-978f-712e1148cfb3"
  }
}
